{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20266D6C1BsyNy1792984634.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>劇集《璀璨之城》自播出以來備受觀眾關注，憑藉一眾演員的落力演出，在網上引發極大迴響。日前眾演員特意現身宣傳活動，除了親自分享本周的矚目劇情外，更搶先預告未來的精彩場面。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"c26b04d7-d48a-4272-9a40-27f8e9de81fd.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026Gpm8agsoYa1792984634.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"32f7445b-5502-4052-9c13-ab625872d936.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026P7pHnvpRno1792984633.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p>宣傳活動上預告的劇情亮點相當吸睛，當中包括吳卓羲、張曦雯與江美儀之間的兒子與婆媳關係發展，以及高海寧與陳瀅兩人的「大婆」及「情婦」關係改變等等，劇情高潮迭起。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"23b7b2b9-3861-46cd-b925-d8840c9dcc79.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026qsXEpJqDNH1792984634.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>此外，眾演員更在現場大玩與劇情相關的趣味互動遊戲，高海寧與張曦雯等人更齊齊化身調酒師，即場調製出劇中出現的「Echoes of Time」特飲，令全場場面十分熱鬧。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:24.321254+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":247,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T03:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:43.404575+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:43.404575+00:00","content_hash":"76b974d67ea751b2834a7e8d2c40c6ffe9f3f3baf1e4d5fa5d09b8e9e9791065","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}